Feature: HA Pattern Reversal at RSI Extremes
  Primary timeframe: 1h
  Parameter overbought_threshold default 70
  Parameter oversold_threshold default 30
  Parameter doji_threshold default 0.1
  Parameter stop_loss_pct default 1.5
  Parameter take_profit_pct default 4

  Scenario: Enter long on oversold doji
    Given no open position
    When ha_doji(doji_threshold)
    And rsi_oversold(oversold_threshold)
    Then long_entry
    And with stop_loss at entry_price * (1 - stop_loss_pct / 100)
    And with take_profit at entry_price * (1 + take_profit_pct / 100)

  Scenario: Exit long on bearish strong
    Given a long position is open
    When ha_strong_bearish()
    Then long_exit

  Scenario: Enter short on overbought doji
    Given no open position
    When ha_doji(doji_threshold)
    And rsi_overbought(overbought_threshold)
    Then short_entry
    And with stop_loss at entry_price * (1 + stop_loss_pct / 100)
    And with take_profit at entry_price * (1 - take_profit_pct / 100)

  Scenario: Exit short on bullish strong
    Given a short position is open
    When ha_strong_bullish()
    Then short_exit
